  "notes": "{寄付|きふ} refers to voluntary giving to charities or causes.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{寄付|きふ}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {寄付|きふ}する (to donate)\n- {寄付|きふ}を{する|募る} (to solicit donations)\n- 〜に{寄付|きふ}する (to donate to ~)\n\nCOMPOUND WORDS:\n- {寄付|きふ}{金|きん} (donation money)\n- {寄付|きふ}{者|しゃ} (donor)\n- {寄付|きふ}{行為|こうい} (act of donation)\n\nALTERNATIVE WRITING:\n- {寄附|きふ} is also used (same meaning)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {募金|ぼきん}: fundraising, collection\n- {献金|けんきん}: contribution (often political)\n- {贈与|ぞうよ}: gift, donation (legal term)",
